Thank you.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:49.230
Calling space control. Satellite SJ-1 ready for scheduled report. Satellite SJ-1 ready for scheduled report. Over.

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:57.310
Space control to SJ-1. Space control to SJ-1. We read you. Come, please.

