00:01:03.810 --> 00:01:04.370
Space control.

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:05.260
Space control.

00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:05.880
Come in, please.

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:07.660
Look at that.

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:10.040
Are you?

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:11.500
Get out of the SOS right away.

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:12.200
We're being attacked.

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:12.800
Prepare emergency.

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:13.880
Come in, space control.

00:01:13.940 --> 00:01:14.620
Bring it right on.

00:01:14.760 --> 00:01:15.240
Space control.

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:16.740
Come in, please.

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:17.460
Space control.

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:18.240
Come in, please.

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:01.700
Let's go.

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:20.450
We'll have to make it up.

00:03:56.300 --> 00:03:59.540
Come on, come on.

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:02.120
Yeah.

00:05:03.640 --> 00:05:07.680
on the headlines on your Tokyo television news this morning.

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:10.010
They are both unexplainable events.

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:12.170
And now for an even more curious news story,

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:14.190
we switch you to our reporter in America.

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:15.650
- This is your announcer, Thomas Sheldon,

00:05:15.650 --> 00:05:17.840
with a special we picked off the wire from New York.

00:05:17.840 --> 00:05:19.400
The American freighter, Blue Queen,

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:21.340
was passing through the Panama Canal

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:23.300
when she was destroyed by a water spout

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:25.120
which left her a pile of twisted junk

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:27.110
draped on the side of the canal.

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:30.000
The cause of this catastrophe is quite unknown.

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:39.220
And while you hear my voice, this announcer in Venice, Italy, is telling his public about a similar occurrence this morning.

00:05:39.660 --> 00:05:46.020
A powerful water spout lifted tons of water from the canals of the city, flooding and destroying many age-old monuments.

00:05:46.680 --> 00:05:53.880
And in order to investigate these mysterious events, the World Council has called an emergency conference to be held at the Space Research Center in Tokyo.

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:57.720
Derogates from various member nations are scheduled to arrive this morning.

00:05:58.720 --> 00:05:59.540
The World Council has called an emergency conference to be held at the Space Research Center in Tokyo.

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:56.270
It is clear from an examination of the circumstances resulting from these three disasters that

00:06:56.270 --> 00:07:00.000
there was a common force at work in each instance.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:02.620
that the survivors were severely frostbitten

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:04.640
is of particular significance,

00:07:04.640 --> 00:07:07.500
indicating that extremely low temperatures

00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:09.480
were somehow produced.

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:11.170
Now, what does this imply?

00:07:11.170 --> 00:07:14.270
Simply that by rapidly lowering the temperature

00:07:14.270 --> 00:07:16.040
of a certain object,

00:07:16.040 --> 00:07:19.090
its gravity would also be decreased.

00:07:19.090 --> 00:07:22.930
- But isn't it impossible to remove gravity

00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:26.150
from a stationary object or a certain place?

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:27.570
- Yes, you are right.

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:30.000
You see, it's been considered impossible up

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:35.670
to now. But now it has happened right here on Earth. And my colleagues, Dr. Adachi and Major

00:07:35.670 --> 00:07:41.330
Katsumir, have a brief analysis of some very interesting data on this subject, which I will

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:52.320
ask them to explain to you. As you know, the cause of gravity is the motion of atoms. And when the atoms of

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:59.380
an object have no movement, its gravity is correspondingly diminished. At the temperature known as absolute zero,

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:06.120
The atomic movement of an object is reduced to a state of rest and it becomes weightless.

00:08:06.120 --> 00:08:09.880
Owing to the centrifugal force of the revolving earth itself,

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:13.660
the object thus affected would rise up into the air.

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:19.860
We are sure that the recent disasters were caused by an operation from space of some sort of freeze ray,

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:24.500
which by reducing temperatures abruptly was able to destroy the gravity of the object's effect.

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:26.120
Are you all right?

00:08:26.120 --> 00:08:28.450
It's all right.

00:08:45.960 --> 00:08:48.660
Hello, Dr. Ahmed. Has the conference ended?

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:27.170
- I don't know, what's this?

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:28.410
Dr. Ahmed, where is he?

00:09:31.560 --> 00:09:37.230
- He was right there! - Well, he isn't there now.

00:09:37.230 --> 00:09:39.200
You must be seeing things.

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:41.900
Amin's at the conference with everybody else.

00:09:41.900 --> 00:09:44.260
But I'm sure he was right there.

00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:47.750
- Oh, there you are, Iwamura. - Yeah?

00:09:47.750 --> 00:09:50.060
Get the heat ray gun set up, firing test.

00:09:50.060 --> 00:09:53.170
Okay. Say, Katsumiya, hmm?

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:55.220
I think Itsuko's a little overtired.

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:57.240
Try to cheer her up, huh?

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:21.390
If we acknowledge the fact that the earth has entered upon the space age, we must be

00:10:21.390 --> 00:10:28.260
prepared to admit that just as we can go from earth to the planets, there must be other

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:30.000
beings whose intelligence is superior to us.

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:36.490
ours to solve the problems of space better than we have. Dr. Adachi, what do you think their purpose

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:42.870
is in coming to the earth? Wouldn't you say they came here impaled by the same kind of scientific

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:48.640
curiosity we might feel about them? Could it be they plan to conquer the people of earth? I only

00:10:48.640 --> 00:10:53.390
wish I knew the answers to these questions, gentlemen. I couldn't care to guess what the

00:10:53.390 --> 00:11:00.000
future holds, though I'm sure we all hope that this is a peaceful visit. Unfortunately, we do

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:06.100
not understand their language, but we should, by all means possible, continue to urge peace.

00:11:06.990 --> 00:11:11.710
On the other hand, however, we should also study measures to repulse them if attacked.

00:11:17.690 --> 00:11:20.370
I hereby declare that this meeting is adjourned.

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:29.240
Inspector Archaeology of the International Police.

00:11:45.770 --> 00:11:47.860
- Gentlemen, this is our new ray gun.

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:50.000
It produces a narrow band energy radiation

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:52.360
of the order of 600 megatherms.

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:55.650
At maximum output, it will fire continuously

00:11:55.650 --> 00:12:00.000
for 20,000 hours with a single charge of plutonium.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:05.740
a series of targets composed of beryllium 19 which is as you are no doubt aware the hardest

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:11.830
metal produced here on earth at present this same alloy is being used for the skin of the speed one

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:15.450
which is now under construction we're ready doctor all right please stand back gentlemen

