I am Inspector Ariaki, International Police.

00:15:51.030 --> 00:15:55.090
I wonder if you can give me some information.

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:57.100
Oh, yes, of course.

00:15:57.100 --> 00:15:59.100
I'm looking for Dr. Ahmed.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:00.000
Can you help me?

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:02.850
- Will you help me find him? - I believe so. He's around here somewhere.

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:04.850
Will you find him at once for me, then, please?

00:16:04.850 --> 00:16:06.850
There are reasons for my haste which I can't explain at the moment.

00:16:06.850 --> 00:16:12.310
Dr. Ahmed, he isn't here, doctor. He didn't come with us.

00:16:12.310 --> 00:16:19.500
Where is he, then?

00:16:19.500 --> 00:16:25.880
Yarmick! Yarmick! There's something wrong in the gun room.

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:30.000
- -

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:38.610
What's going on here?

00:16:38.770 --> 00:16:39.190
Stop that.

00:16:42.670 --> 00:16:43.970
The ray gun.

00:16:44.260 --> 00:16:44.780
I caught him.

00:16:44.940 --> 00:16:45.780
He was trying to steal it.

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:47.560
Man, is that true?

