Well, come on.

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:06.560
Cowards, all of you.

00:17:06.560 --> 00:17:08.200
Eventually you'll be our slaves.

00:17:08.200 --> 00:17:10.080
The whole life will become a colonial satellite

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:12.930
for our glorious planet, Natal.

00:17:12.930 --> 00:17:13.930
- Hamid, don't.

00:17:13.930 --> 00:17:14.690
- Wait.

00:17:14.690 --> 00:17:15.610
Get back.

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:17.300
- All of you.

00:17:17.300 --> 00:17:22.100
- Get back.

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:23.360
- Get back.

