- What is this?

00:18:31.520 --> 00:18:32.920
- There's something there.

00:18:32.920 --> 00:18:33.920
- It frightens one.

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:34.920
- It certainly doesn't.

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:35.920
- Oh, it disappeared.

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:36.920
