00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.780
Implanting to arm his brain,

00:19:08.780 --> 00:19:11.200
it would make him respond to radio wave impulses.

00:19:19.560 --> 00:19:23.210
- It is clear that the inhabitants of the planet Natal

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:27.370
have established an advanced base on our moon,

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:30.000
and they are planning to attack the Earth.

00:19:30.380 --> 00:19:32.150
from this base.

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:36.810
Mankind has lived on the earth for the past 500,000 years.

00:19:36.810 --> 00:19:41.130
Now he must be prepared to resist the attacks

00:19:41.130 --> 00:19:48.120
of the interplanetary bandits of outer space.

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:53.530
We are going to send two spaceships to the moon.

00:19:53.530 --> 00:19:56.890
Dr. Atachi, the eminent scientist,

00:19:56.890 --> 00:19:59.000
will command the crew of the first ship.

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:12.490
Dr. Richardson will command the crew of the second ship.

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:25.880
And now for the details of the flight.

00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:28.570
Dr. Itachi, will you tell us something about that?

00:20:28.570 --> 00:20:30.000
Well, of course.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:33.820
We consider this as just a reconnaissance flight.

00:20:33.820 --> 00:20:39.730
We expect to land at a point 100 kilometers north of the Sea of Rains.

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:45.590
Our radio telescopes indicate that mysterious radio signals are being transmitted from that area.

00:21:13.280 --> 00:21:22.360
