00:21:23.270 --> 00:21:26.040
And there are creatures up there about to attack us.

00:21:26.120 --> 00:21:27.620
I know.

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:38.790
Yes, but it looks more beautiful when you imagine that there's a prince waiting up there

00:21:38.790 --> 00:21:42.230
who's going to come down and carry you away forever.

00:21:45.060 --> 00:21:52.140
I think that we humans will gradually lose such feelings of beauty.

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:04.810
Katsumiya, isn't there one thing that will always be the same?

00:22:05.270 --> 00:22:07.260
There must be one thing.

00:22:09.280 --> 00:22:12.400
Don't you understand what I mean?

00:22:14.000 --> 00:22:16.580
But there's one thing that we'll never lose.

00:22:17.710 --> 00:22:19.830
We'll always love each other, no matter what happens.

00:22:20.880 --> 00:22:22.680
On the earth or on the moon.

00:22:23.840 --> 00:22:30.000
Well, I guess, you know, I wonder.

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:38.300
- I won't let, it just can't.

00:22:38.300 --> 00:22:41.280
Our love will never change.

00:22:41.280 --> 00:22:43.470
Say that you'll love me forever.

00:22:43.470 --> 00:22:51.250
