00:23:31.790 --> 00:23:34.320
Let's all go to town. How would you like that?

00:23:36.430 --> 00:23:36.710
Where?

00:23:37.260 --> 00:23:40.740
I'd like to have some fun. There won't be any in the moon, I know.

00:23:41.400 --> 00:23:42.620
You can be sure of that.

00:23:43.890 --> 00:23:47.400
That's right. So before we go, I'd like to go kiss the girls goodbye.

00:23:48.590 --> 00:23:49.330
Do you want to come along?

00:23:49.780 --> 00:23:50.280
Why not?

00:23:50.730 --> 00:23:52.510
I don't think so. I'm doing all right here.

00:23:53.290 --> 00:23:54.490
Watch out for that guy, Itzuko.

00:23:55.570 --> 00:23:58.750
Well, I guess I'll go by myself. See you later.

00:24:02.200 --> 00:24:02.790
You make it?

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:05.800
You have planted our life in your brain, and you are now a slain.

00:25:11.360 --> 00:25:21.750
What we tell you to do, we welcome you as a new servant of the glorious planet, Natal.

00:25:23.340 --> 00:25:28.520
Now go, go, go.

00:25:48.880 --> 00:25:50.890
- You can't walk your car here.

