- Huh?

00:25:51.580 --> 00:25:55.420
- Ah, look now, what's wrong with you?

00:25:55.420 --> 00:25:58.160
- Your forehead's bleeding, what happened?

00:26:08.990 --> 00:26:14.090
tremendous crowd here today waiting for that moment when a brilliant new chapter will be recorded in

